{"id":"H4316","lemma":"מִיכָא","transliteration":"mikah","sayIt":"mi-KAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Mica","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1Ch.9.15;\nson of: Zichri (H2147K);\nfather of: Mattaniah (H4983)\nAlso named: mi.khah (מִיכָה \"Mica\" H4318L)\n§ Micha = \"who is like God\"\n1) son of Mephibosheth\n2) a Levite who signed the covenant with Nehemiah\n3) father of Mattaniah, a Gershonite Levite and descendant of Asaph","glosses":["mica"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Mica","kjv":"was Micha"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Mica","kjv":"of Micah"}},{"chapterId":"neh-10","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Mica","kjv":"Micha"}},{"chapterId":"neh-11","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Mica","kjv":"of Micha"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Samuel 9:12","note":"Mephibosheth had a young son, whose name was Mica. All that lived in Ziba’s house were servants to Mephibosheth.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 9:15","note":"and Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal, and Mattaniah the son of Mica, the son of Zichri, the son of Asaph,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 10:11","note":"Mica, Rehob, Hashabiah,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H4318","lemma":"מִיכָה","transliteration":"mikhah","gloss":"Micah"},{"id":"H4983","lemma":"מַתַּנְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"mattanyah","gloss":"Mattaniah"},{"id":"H4320","lemma":"מִיכָיָה","transliteration":"mikhayah","gloss":"Micaiah"},{"id":"H2147","lemma":"זִכְרִי","transliteration":"zikhri","gloss":"Zichri"},{"id":"H4648","lemma":"מְפִיבֹשֶׁת","transliteration":"mephivoshet","gloss":"Mephibosheth"},{"id":"H6377","lemma":"פִּיתוֹן","transliteration":"piton","gloss":"Pithon"},{"id":"H4429","lemma":"מֶ֫לֶךְ","transliteration":"melekh","gloss":"Melech"},{"id":"H8390","lemma":"תַּאֲרֵעַ","transliteration":"taarea","gloss":"Tarea"}],"senses":[{"id":"H4316H","gloss":"Mica","relation":"H4316H ="},{"id":"H4316I","gloss"